docs {
  # Authentication

  Bearer-token API. Register or log in to get a 15-minute JWT access token and an opaque,
  single-use refresh token (30-day absolute session). Send the access token as
  `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`; exchange the refresh token at `/auth/refresh`.

  Run the folder in order: **Register** generates a disposable email and password with a
  pre-request script and stores them, and every token, only in Bruno runtime variables. Nothing
  secret is committed and runtime variables are not written to disk.

  Every auth response sends `Cache-Control: no-store`. Contract: `docs/api-contract.md`.
}
